  "text": "The Fianna are a band of Irish warriors. In one tale, the figure Abarta tricked them into mounting his frail old horse. The horse carried the warriors to the Otherworld, where Abarta held them hostage. It took many magical exploits and battles before Fionn freed them. Afterward Fionn did not invite Abarta to join the band.",
